    <string name="guide_page1_title">CoolMall - Open Source E-Commerce Learning Project</string>
    <string name="guide_page1_desc">Modern e-commerce app developed in 100% Kotlin\nCompletely open source and free, helping developers grow fast\nProviding complete code references and learning resources</string>
    <string name="guide_page2_title">Declarative UI Experience</string>
    <string name="guide_page2_desc">Build smooth interfaces with Jetpack Compose\nMVVM + Clean Architecture\nFull integration of Hilt, Coroutines, Flow and more</string>
    <string name="guide_page3_title">Complete E-Commerce Process</string>
    <string name="guide_page3_desc">User authentication, product display, search &amp; categories\nShopping cart management, full order &amp; payment flow\nLearning cases close to real business scenarios</string>
    <string name="guide_page4_title">Modular Architecture Design</string>
    <string name="guide_page4_desc">Reference to Google Now in Android best practices\nHigh cohesion, low coupling, easy to maintain and extend\nQuality project for learning and secondary development</string>
